<%#
  Step List — the builder's step list as an outline of the graph (workflows/_step_outline)

  Local variables:
  - workflow: Workflow object
  - steps: ordered step collection (preloaded with transitions)

  Rows always render unselected. Which row is selected is a client-side fact
  read from the open panel (builder_controller#syncSelectedRow) — see that
  controller for why: a server-picked selected_step here raced the same
  subtree's Action Cable rebroadcast in a solo editor's own browser.
%>
<div class="builder__list"
     id="step-list"
     data-controller="step-list">

  <%# Collapse all / Expand all. Hidden until outline-fold finds a fold to act
      on; not edit-only - a viewer folds too. %>
  <div class="builder__list-tools">
    <button type="button" class="btn btn--plain btn--sm builder__outline-toggle-all" hidden
            data-outline-fold-target="toggleAll"
            data-action="outline-fold#toggleAll">Collapse all</button>
  </div>

  <div class="builder__list-scroll">
    <div id="steps-list"
         data-step-list-target="list"
         role="tree" aria-label="Steps">
      <% if steps.any? %>
        <%= render "workflows/step_outline", workflow: workflow, outline: StepOutline.call(workflow, steps) %>
      <% else %>
        <%= render "workflows/empty_state", workflow: workflow %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%# The unconnected add (edit mode only) — outside the scroll area so the
      popover is not clipped. A trailing row that invites an action, per
      .list-row--prompt.

      It says "unconnected" because that is what it makes: a step nothing leads
      to, which the author then has to wire. A step that FOLLOWS another is
      grown from its door chip in the outline or from its panel, and
      arrives already connected — see AGENTS.md § Growing a workflow. %>
  <div class="builder__list-add-wrapper builder__edit-only">
    <button type="button"
            class="list-row list-row--compact list-row--prompt builder__list-add"
            data-action="click->step-list#toggleTypePicker">
      <span class="list-row__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <%= icon "plus", class: "icon icon--sm" %>
      </span>
      <span class="list-row__body">
        <span class="list-row__title">Add unconnected step</span>
      </span>
    </button>
    <%= render "workflows/type_picker", workflow: workflow %>
  </div>
</div>
